{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：09:48 2026-08-25 HKT</p>\n\n<p>大埔翠屏商場地下一間售賣滷水食物的店舖，遭人淋潑紅色油漆。今日（25日）早上7時59分，滷水店職員返回舖頭準備開門營業時，赫然發現店舖的鐵閘、儲存食物的凍櫃及地面遍佈紅油，連忙報警求助。</p>\n<p>現場是安慈路3號，警員到場後翻查閉路電視片段調查。據了解，案發於昨晚（24日）深夜約11時許，3名男子推着載有紅油容器的手推車，到滷水店淋油，其中一名歹徒身穿白衫短褲。</p>\n<img alt=\"滷水店遭淋紅油。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c1c386821ec5177475a4db3331860651/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_09_24_17.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f2b66e66e5fee35311c48135e940eeee/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_09_24_16_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/34f615e0e95bf367a9a76d03f3207ec3/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_09_24_16.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"店舖的鐵閘、儲存食物的凍櫃及地面滿佈紅油。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/7a5d1bd47beaafbf00bdad4d218d38da/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_09_24_16_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/7858c6e5ec5c2e94925934efb215f7f2/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_09_24_15_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<p>店主廖先生表示，滷水店開業至今5年，他並無欠債，亦沒有與人結怨或發生糾紛，之前未曾接獲恐嚇。他無奈稱：「我都想知咩事，冇頭緒，冇得罪人。」警方列作刑事毀壞案，正追緝歹徒歸案。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5566139523ef8e57bbf4ad84fa65e0b4/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_09_24_15_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"店舖的鐵閘、儲存食物的凍櫃及地面滿佈紅油。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a9b667d37d99956b191da8750bf5f861/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_09_24_15.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/fd5d917dcab0d04f6ee4b4e5e05f7c48/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_09_24_14_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/dd2cf298107293f73ba1291de3948e4f/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_09_24_14_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/56def55a532780feea416451a1b38dda/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_09_24_14.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"涉事滷水店位於大埔翠屏商場地下。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c273e6531f5606831216ae759c58ca67/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_09_24_13_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f5ec7b6f5dd097ffd6ed11611cce570d/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_09_24_13.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T01:59:43.494806+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":292,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}